  unitName: Tridon the Judicious
  unitId: 820148
  unitNumber: 8377
  description: As Grand Admiral of Athensphere's Navy, Tridon was charged with the
    duty of defending the coasts of Athensphere against her enemies. When the traitor
    Gazia launched his attack against Athensphere, even the stalwart defense led
    by the mighty Tridon eventually crumbled before the onslaught of mechanical hydras.
    However, his valiant efforts bought Athensphere many precious days that allowed
    the citizens of Athensphere to safely evacuate the city.
  summonDesc: What is it that you seek?<br>If your cause proves to be just,<br>then
    you will have my protection.
  fusionDesc: Power is a great burden to bear.<br>The weight of a thousand responsibilities
    shall rest upon the one that wields it.
